sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Inspector
    participant Mobile as React Native App
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend
    participant AIService as AI Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Storage as Object Storage

    Inspector->>Mobile: Open camera, capture product image
    Mobile->>Mobile: Validate image quality (blur, size)
    Mobile->>Mobile: Optionally scan barcode/QR
    Mobile->>Backend: POST /scans/ with image + GPS + barcode
    Backend->>Storage: Save uploaded image
    Backend->>AIService: POST /predict with image path
    AIService->>AIService: YOLO object detection
    AIService->>AIService: Product classification (EfficientNet)
    AIService->>AIService: Spoilage / packaging analysis
    AIService->>AIService: Build explainable findings
    AIService-->>Backend: Return product, condition, confidence, findings
    Backend->>Backend: Check barcode vs AI condition (discrepancy flag)
    Backend->>DB: Store scan record
    Backend-->>Mobile: Return ScanRead + report_id
    Mobile->>Inspector: Display AI result with Accept / Override
    alt Inspector accepts
        Mobile->>Backend: POST /scans/{id}/feedback (accept)
        Backend->>DB: Update inspector_accepted = true
    else Inspector overrides
        Mobile->>Backend: POST /scans/{id}/feedback (override + reason)
        Backend->>DB: Update override condition/reason
        Backend->>DB: Create ReviewRequest if severe
    end
    opt Generate report
        Inspector->>Mobile: Request PDF/Excel/CSV report
        Mobile->>Backend: GET /reports/{id}/download?format=
        Backend->>Storage: Generate and store file
        Backend-->>Mobile: Return download URL
    end
